# FinGrind runtime container assembly is built from the staged Docker build context emitted by
# `./gradlew :cli:stageDockerBuildContext`, not from the repository root. Repository-root `docker build .` is intentionally unsupported
# for runtime container assembly: its sender cannot walk arbitrary checkout-local state or sibling build outputs. The contributor
# devcontainer uses this root context only to copy its checksum-pinned PowerShell provisioner module set and canonical build metadata.
# No arbitrary checkout-local state enters either build context.
**
!.devcontainer/
!.devcontainer/Dockerfile
!gradle/
!gradle/fingrind-build.properties
!scripts/
!scripts/powershell_provisioning_cli.py
!scripts/powershell_provisioning_tree.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime_archives.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime_cache.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime_download.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime_installation.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime_metadata.py
!scripts/powershell_runtime_models.py
!scripts/provision-powershell-runtime.py
